    "lot_code_rule": "BEST BEFORE / 此日期前最佳",
    "usage_text": "PREPARATION: Boil 900 grams of pork ribs for 5 minutes and rinse it to remove scum. COOKING METHOD: 1. Boil 1800 ml of water with 25 pieces of garlic and 2 sachets of spices for 15 minutes. (2 sachets in each packet) 2. Add 900 grams of pork ribs. 3. Add ½ teaspoon of dark soya sauce and ½ teaspoon of light soya sauce. 4. Simmer on medium heat for 50 - 60 minutes. 5. Remove sachets after simmering for 50 - 60 minutes or anytime after to suit individual preference on spiciness. RECOMMENDATION: Song Fa spices can be used as a soup base for hot pot. Other types of meat can be used as an alternative to pork ribs.",
